# Bulk regression case (assistant-written): the three declarations that need a
# body and do not have one. Each is reported at the NEXT declaration's line —
# except the last, which has no next declaration in this file and falls back to
# its own keyword. It used to point at the EOF line; the library appended to
# every compilation (§1.11) made that "the library's first line", which is a
# place the author cannot open, so `Cursor::here_or` clamps it here instead.
constant MAX: int

record Point  #~ missing_body

variant Token  #~ empty_record #~ empty_variant
